commit 346016c48c26575ecbdaa5c03abed8ad73d35c60

C03: clarify unreadable input, bare negation and assent without antecedent (DIALOGUE1277 repair)

Mind: _unresolved_input_kind routes text without a readable request (only symbols, digits, a single letter) or a bare negation to a composed clarification (clarify_unresolved_input) before the model plans; the deictic reading accepts «si hazlo», «dale, hacelo», «hacelo»; clarify_missing_referent tells the model a voseo imperative is an order, retries once when the question attributes the action to the user's past, and fails closed otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


